EREST,  TAD     SEQSW           /<^C> OR <^D> APPEAR?
        SNA CLA                 /SKIP IF NOT
        JMP     EDTRM           /JUMP IF SO
        TAD I   LINST           /GET POINTER TO START OF LINE
