NEWSCH, TAD     PSRCHX          /GET THE MAGIC JUMP
UPC,    DCA I   PEDSWIT         /AND MODIFY CHLOOP 
        ZBLOCK  1               /HARMLESS AND TO DELIMIT MESSAGE
        JMP I   PCHLOOP         /NOW GO READ ANOTHER CHAR.

SRCHX,  CIA                     /COMPLEMENT THE SEARCH CHAR.
CTRLF,  DCA     SCHAR           /AND SAVE FOR LATER
        TAD     CATCORE         /GET A NOP
        DCA I   PEDSWIT         /AND FIX CHLOOP TO RUN AGAIN
EDSLP1, JMS I   GETHAF          /GET A CHARACTER FROM THE LINE
        SNA                     /OK IF IT'S NOT AN END OF LINE
