        TAD     CHAR            /RETRIEVE THE CHARACTER
        TAD     SCHAR           /IS THIS THE ONE?
        SZA CLA                 /SKIP IF IT IS
        JMP     EDSLP1          /ELSE TRY AGAIN
        JMP I   PCHLOOP         /READ TEXT IF FOUND A MATCH

