        SNA                     /SKIP IF ANY ERRORS
        JMP I   PBEGN1          /ELSE MODIFY LINE
        SPA CLA                 /SKIP IF ABORT
        JMP I   WHAT            /PRINT "WHAT?" IF AN ERROR
        JMS I   PR6BIT          /DO A NEW-LINE
        JMP I   PBEGIN          /ABORT EDIT COMMAND
CTRLK,  TAD     EDLIN           /POINT US BACK
        DCA     PUTNDX          /TO END OF LINE NUMBER
        TAD     PUTNDX          /GET NEW VALUE
