PEWHAT, EWHAT                   /POINTER TO EWHAT
PERST,  EREST                   /POINTER TO EREST
PSRCHX, PEDSCH&177+5600         /REALLY A "JMP I  PEDSCH"
PXGL1,  XGLINE+1                /POINTER TO GLINE HEAD
PBEGN1, BEGIN1                  /POINTER TO BEGIN1
PEDCH1, EDCH1                   /POINTER TO EDCH1
