EEREAD, EREAD                   /POINTER TO BATCH CHARACTER FEEDER
EEBRK,  EBRK                    /POINTER TO BATCH "R" TRAP
EEMORE, EMORE                   /TEST MORE HERE
EETEST, ETEST                   /WHERE TEST CHARACTER IS
