EBACK,  TAD I   EPTR            /FETCH A WORD
        SNA                     /SKIP IF ITS OK
        JMP     EOF             /ELSE TAKE END OF FILE BRANCH
        CLL RTR                 /\
        RTR                     / >WOULDN'T YOU RATHER USE A BSW
        RTR                     //
        JMS     ETRIM           /GO TRIM CHARACTER
