EOT,    TAD     GLINE           /ALLOW A NORMAL EXTENDED
        DCA     RST             /COMMAND OR "R"
        TAD     EEDCOM          /RESTORE
        DCA I   EDSLOT          /"EDIT" COMMAND
        TAD     EJMPBGN         /ALLOW
