        DCA I   WHATMORE        /ALL EXTENDED COMMAND AND "R" ERRORS BOOTSTRAP
        TAD     ECHECK          /RESTORE THE
        DCA     UNIT            /PREVIOUS UNIT
        JMP I   GLINE           /GO DO EXTENDED COMMAND PART 2

EFILE,  SFILES-1                /FILE POINTER
