        TAD     FLAGS                   /GET IT BACK
        TAD     BL7600                  /CHECK IF WE CHECKSUM
        SPA CLA                         /SKIP IF NO
        TAD     FLAGS                   /ADD IT IN IF YES
        TAD     BCHECK                  /GET CURRENT CHECKSUM ALSO
        DCA     BCHECK                  /SAVE IT BACK
        TAD     FLAGS                   /RESTORE AC
LOPUN,  TSFIOT                          /WAIT FOR
