SLVRES, NOPUNCH                         /FOOL THE ASSEMBLER

        *SLOAD                          /WHERE IT WILL GO

        ENPUNCH                         /RESTORE BINARY OUTPUT

SLOAD,  JMS     SYSIO                   /CALL I/O ROUTINES
SCORE,  0                               /CORE ARGUMENT
SFUN,   WRITE                           /WRITE ALL OF FIELD 0 OUT
SBLOCK, BINADR                          /INTO BINARY SCRATCH AREA
