BCHEKST,CHEKST                  /POINTER TO DEFAULT START CHECK ROUTINE
BIBLK,  IBLOCK                  /I BLOCK
BBHZAP, BHZAP                   /WHERE TO PREVENT DATA FIELD AND STARTING PROBLEMS
