SRETRY, LCD                     /LOAD COMMAND   7326    NL0002
SCDFZP, CDF     HFIELD          /LOAD HELPER    6214    RDF
SLODLP, JMS     SLODIT&177+2    /GET A WORD     1224    TAD     SCDF
