        SBOOT                   /REALLY BOOTSTRAP

SBOOT1, DMAR+1                  /WHERE WE CAME IN

        NOPUNCH                 /PUT ORIGIN BACK

        *.-SBTMOV+SPMST         /WHERE WE REALLY ARE

        ENPUNCH                 /THAT'S BETTER

        ZBLOCK  -.              /EMPTY SPACE

