        SDRC                    /GET STATUS
        AND     RR300           /TIME OR WRITE LOCKED?
        CIF     00              /EITHER WAY GOTO FIELD 0
        SZA CLA                 /SKIP IF OK
        JMP     SERROR          /BARF INTO FIELD 0
