SERR,   HLT                     /HALT ON ERRORS
S7760,  SMA SZA SNL CLA         /CONSTANT 7760 WHICH SKIPS

SGO,    SPA CLA                 /GOING RIGHT WAY?
STURNX, NL4000                  /NO, GO TURN AROUND
        TAD     SDIR            /ADD ON CURRENT DIRECTION
