        TAD     SUNIT           /ADD ON UNIT BIT IN BIT[0]
S1000,  TAD     S1000           /ADD ON GO BIT IN BIT[2]
        SDLC                    /START UP THE TAPE
        SDSQ                    /WAIT FOR
        JMP     .-1             /6 LINES
        SDRD                    /TO ASSURE
        JMS     SMARK           /GOOD DATA
SEARCH, JMS     SMARK           /READ A MARK
        TAD     S7670           /END ZONE?
