        RTR                     /UNITS TO BIT[0], LINK
        SPA CLA                 /ODD UNIT?
        TAD     S1454           /YES, ADD OFFSET
        SZL                     /DOUBLE UNIT?
        TAD     S3130           /YES, ADD OFFSET
