        ISZ     SYSIO           /BUMP TO FINAL
        DCA     SBLK            /SAVE AS DISK SECTOR
        TAD     SFUNCT          /GET FUNCTION
        AND     S4070           /JUST READ/WRITE, FIELD BITS
        SZL                     /DID BLOCK OVERFLOW?
        IAC                     /YES, ADJUST
