        SZA CLA                 /ARE WE DONE?
        JMP     SCHECK          /NO, GO DO ANOTHER
SOUT,   CIF CDF 00              /YES, GO BACK TO CALLER'S FIELD
        JMP I   SYSIO           /RETURN
 
SCDF,   CDF     00              /CDF CONSTANT
